Remove a host route of this worktree: its route file, then its entry in the
registration. Needs a registered worktree: run `berth up` first. `berth route
ls` lists the names.

Usage:
  berth route rm <name> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for rm

Global Flags:
      --config string   path to berth.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
  -V, --version         output the version number
